# ATTILA AI Enhanced Function Management System Rules

## Project Context
- This is an enhancement of existing ATTILA AI chat application
- Goal: Transform into sophisticated function orchestration platform
- Target: <2s execution time, >90% AI router accuracy
- Stack: FastAPI + SvelteKit + SQLite/PostgreSQL

## Development Priorities
1. Performance optimization (target <2s execution)
2. AI router accuracy (target >90%)
3. Multi-function coordination (1-5 simultaneous)
4. Real-time monitoring and analytics
5. Visual function builder for non-technical users

## Code Standards
- Backend: Python 3.11+, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Pydantic
- Frontend: SvelteKit, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- Testing: >90% coverage requirement
- Documentation: Update for all new features

## Implementation Phases
Phase 1: Database enhancement + AI router
Phase 2: Function executors + API endpoints  
Phase 3: Frontend components + chat enhancement
Phase 4: Performance optimization + deployment

## Critical Requirements
- Maintain backward compatibility with existing chat
- Follow security best practices
- Implement comprehensive error handling
- Add performance monitoring and analytics
- Support for 4 function types: MCP, API, Prompt, Document